  "bio": [
    "Wang Ning is the founder, chairman and CEO of Hong Kong-listed toy maker Pop Mart International Group.",
    "Set up in 2010, it sells small figurines and plush toys in so-called blind box packaging that doesn't reveal the exact toys inside.",
    "Pop Mart's Labubu line of dolls once ignited a global collection craze over the rabbit-ish creature that has jagged teeth and a mischievous grin.",
    "The company has launched Labubu-themed jewelry and bakery brands as it seeks additional revenue streams. It has also built a theme park named Pop Land in Beijing."
  ],
  "about": [
    "Labubu was created by Hong Kong-born artist Kasing Lung. It has been collected by celebrities including Dua Lipa, Rihanna and Blackpink's Lisa."
  ]
